* SPICE Netlist for Op-Amp Circuit

* Resistors
R1a 1 3 50k
R1b 4 3 50k
R2a 3 2 100k
R2b 3 5 100k

* Capacitors
C1 2 0 1p
C2 5 0 1p

* Op-Amp (ideal)
XU1 3 4 5 0 opamp

* Note: The 'opamp' subcircuit needs to be defined separately,
* or an appropriate model should be used depending on the simulation tool.
